    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Unity Conductor.</strong> You have become a living routing node for collective will.</p><ul><li><p>As long as you are alive, active, and in communication with your faction’s leadership, your faction gains <strong>+2 Soft Power OP per strategic turn</strong>. This stacks with any other Soft Power modifiers.</p></li><li><p>If you are Staggered, missing, or clearly not participating in operations for an extended period, the GM may temporarily suspend this benefit until you are back in play.</p></li></ul>",
